  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The element A is $\\mathrm{ns}^{2} p^{1}$ and $\\mathrm{B}$ is $\\mathrm{ns}^{2} p^{4}$. They can form compound of the type $\\mathrm{A}_{2} \\mathrm{~B}_{3}$",
